@startuml 图2-38 序列图：处理兑换订单（UC-12 用例实现）
' 依据：需求规格说明书用例清单；代码 apps/api/internal/httpserver 与 repo（2026-11-26）
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor "运营管理员" as A
participant "前端\n(AdminOrdersPage)" as FE
participant "Router + RequireAdmin" as API
participant "AdminHandler\n(httpserver/admin.go)" as H
participant "Store\n(repo/admin.go)" as S
database "MySQL\n(redeem_order / outbox)" as DB

A -> FE : 打开后台订单列表
FE -> API : GET /api/v1/admin/orders?status=PAID
API -> API : RequireAdmin（role=ADMIN）
alt 非管理员
  API --> FE : 403 FORBIDDEN
else 管理员
  API -> H : listOrders()
  H -> S : ListAllOrders(query)
  S -> DB : COUNT + SELECT ... LIMIT/OFFSET
  DB --> S : orders
  S --> H : Page<Order>
  H --> API : 200
  API --> FE : 响应壳
end

A -> FE : 确认收款 / 发货 / 完成
FE -> API : POST /api/v1/admin/orders/{id}/confirm\n{reason}
API -> H : transition("PAID")
H -> H : 解析 id；reason 可选
H -> S : TransitionOrder(id, target, reason)
S -> DB : BEGIN
S -> DB : SELECT status, order_no\nFROM redeem_order WHERE id=? FOR UPDATE
alt 订单不存在
  S -> DB : ROLLBACK
  S --> H : ErrNotFound
  H --> API : 404 NOT_FOUND
else 非法跃迁
  S -> DB : ROLLBACK
  S --> H : ErrIllegalTransition
  H --> API : 409 ILLEGAL_TRANSITION
else 合法
  S -> DB : UPDATE redeem_order SET status=?, shipped_at/completed_at
  S -> DB : INSERT event_outbox(OrderConfirmed/Shipped/Completed)
  S -> DB : COMMIT
  S --> H : Order
  H --> API : 200
  API --> FE : 响应壳
  FE --> A : 刷新订单状态
end

note over S, DB
  状态机：PENDING → PAID | CANCELLED；PAID → SHIPPED | CANCELLED；
  SHIPPED → COMPLETED | CANCELLED。confirm/ship/complete 三个入口复用同一方法。
end note

@enduml
